# Third-party notices

Generated from the locked dependency graph with cargo-about 0.9.2. Includes target-specific dependencies, so this is a conservative superset of a native binary's components. The component table records declared SPDX expressions; the license texts below cover the alternatives selected by cargo-about under about.toml. This is not a relicensing of third-party code.

Exact package sources/checksums are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_SOURCES.json. For an unchanged registry package, its original source archive is available at `https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/<name>/<version>/download`. Release bundles include the source archives of MPL-2.0 packages. Retain this document, the source inventory and the project's MIT LICENSE when distributing binaries.

